      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也许是因为夕阳的照射吧，\n美浦波旁的脸颊看起来多了点红润。",
      "source_fingerprint": "717cf4666a2fd533d3c0e0db674fad4e282ae7482315bb390ce8557606cbd88e",
