      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本旅馆的温泉属于“单纯温泉”──\n也就是适用于普遍大众的症状，像是神经痛、\n肌肉酸痛等，有促进健康的疗效。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d653db70bb2991fe24867a989563dd2963dced639c3d9f136992bc845ecc8c0d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
